Downloaded 2026-11-03. Original MIDI: 7590 bytes.
SHA-256: 1c12c21c7bbf4cf163896732672648a69d497636059837abd153c71abe50215a

Changes in Flow Piano:
- Exact original MIDI bytes retained as base64 in dist/fur-elise.mjs.
- All original MIDI note events retained in their original two tracks.
- A separate practice part selects the first 35 notes of the upper staff,
  preserving their pitches, tick positions, duration and velocity.
- Practice phrase boundaries are added at indices 0, 9, 17 and 27.
- No notes are transposed or invented. Lower-staff accompaniment is not
  included in the opening practice part. The complete original remains
  available separately; it is not presented as monophonic beginner practice.
